  "description": "This is a custom-designed balisong, commonly known as a butterfly knife. The defining characteristic of this weapon is the fan-like opening of a freely pivoting blade, allowing rapid deployment or concealment. As a result, butterfly knives are outlawed in many countries. It has been anodized orange and hand-etched in a tiger stripe pattern.\\n\\n<i>Like the tiger it is rare... like the tiger it is deadly...</i>",
